Bind Npc 13013 Zone 21
Quest 60 "Worm hunt"
    Journal "[Sentinel] Patrick has asked me to hunt him 5 Worms."
    Kill 5 of 750, 700, 751, 752 at direction_1

Requires player level >= 1

Rewards
    Give 50 experience
    Give 10 of 389010000
    Give 5 of 389016000
    Give 2000 coins

direction_1 = location "Worm" about "Worm\nA giant worm-like monster which levels head-on attacks with long tentacles and body" found "Inhabits the bridgefront outside Moradon central gate" at 637 429 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Uh-oh, Master, you're short on Noahs. You'll have a hard time making ends meet.. Go see Sentinel Patrick. I heard they're hiring extra guards."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Moradon maintains peace at all times as we protect it from monsters which were created by the war against Pathos. Incidentally, I'm running low on guards lately. Can you lend a hand?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "If you exit through that gate you'll spot Worms right outside. They began to breed after the war against Pathos. Go hunt me 5 of those pesky monsters!!"

On in_progress
    Say "Listen, capture all 5. Is that the best you can do?"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_1

On ready
    Say "I hunted all 5 Worms. Report it to the guards"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
